-- Omitted (Stage 3.2.2 describe WIP in cmd_microflows_show_gen.go, known debt):
--   HD.DS_GetMyProfile  — split type + cast describe to non-re-parseable syntax
--   HD.ACT_ChangePassword — raise error / show home page not yet formatted
